    "Cost": 12173131,
    "UIName": "Kratos Prime",
    "Id": "vehicledef_KRATOS_PRIME",
    "Name": "Kratos Prime",
    "Details": "Created to replace the slow and poorly regarded Mars, the Kratos is a 95 ton OmniTank developed by Hells Horses scientists. Powered by a 285 XL Engine, the tank is capable of reaching speeds of 50 kph and is armoured with 17 tons of Ferro Fibrous armour. Only ever fielded by the Horses, the Kratos is the hammer used by the elite Alpha and Beta galaxies to crush any opposition they encounter. The Prime configuration is armed with a pair of Artemis IV enhanced LRM-15's and a pair of LB-10X's. An ER Larger Laser and 3 Vehicle Flamers round out the design.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       400     50\n<b>Left</b>         365     50\n<b>Right</b>       365     50\n<b>Rear</b>        265     50\n<b>Turret</b>      300     50\n\n<b>Total</b>      1695    250</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
    "Icon": "Demolisher"
  },
